      "extract": "In this work we have given exact formulae for the Clebsch-Gordan coefficients of the tensor product of two principal unitary representations of the quantum Lorentz Group. We have found explicit expressions of the intertwiners in terms of q-Racah polynomials and Askey-Wilson polynomials. A consequence of this relation is the proof of the proposition ([\\[askeyproof\\]](#askeyproof){reference-type=\"ref\"",
